## 조건문

### if 문

```cpp
if (x < y) {
    cout << y;
} else if (x == y) {
    cout << "equal";
} else {
    cout << x;
}
```

### 삼항 연산자

```cpp
cout << (x < y) ? "X" : "Y";
```

### switch 문

```cpp
switch (x) {
    case 1:
        cout << "X";
        break;
    case 2:
        cout << "Y";
        break;
    default:
        cout << "Z";
}
```

---

## 반복문

### while 문

```cpp
while (i < 5) {
    cout << i;
    i++;
}
```

### do-while 문

```cpp
do {
    cout << j;
    j++;
} while (j < 5);
```

### for 문

```cpp
for (int k = 0; k < 5; k++) {
    cout << k;
}
```

